### PLATFORM AUTH
POST http://localhost:3000/api/platform/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{"idToken":"token"}

### CREATE WORKSPACE
POST http://localhost:3000/api/platform/workspaces
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"ColaboStore Centro","adminEmail":"admin@demo.cl","planId":"PLAN_ID"}

### CREATE VENDOR
POST http://localhost:3000/api/workspace/vendor-stores
Content-Type: application/json
x-workspace-id: seed-workspace
x-user-workspace-id: seed-workspace

{"name":"Vendor Uno"}

### CREATE SALE
POST http://localhost:3000/api/workspace/sales
Content-Type: application/json
x-workspace-id: seed-workspace
x-user-workspace-id: seed-workspace

{"paymentMethod":"CARD","items":[{"productId":"prod-id","quantity":1}]}

### PUBLIC SUMMARY
GET http://localhost:3000/api/public/vendor/TOKEN/summary
